      "En" : "The two of us have injured our backs, you see,\r\nso we moved to this place with a relatively \r\nstable climate where we can see the sea.\r\nBut never did we expect to encounter such a \r\nterrifying thing.\r\nWe were so shocked that we ran away in a panic,\r\nour bodies trembling with fear.\r\nI can't relax and rest properly here.",
